  <title>sysuTobo 的博客</title>
  <updated>2026-11-26T07:35:30.260Z</updated>
  <entry>
    <author>
      <name>sysuTobo</name>
    </author>
    <category term="随笔" scheme="https://sysutobo.github.io/blog/categories/%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%94/"/>
    <category term="GitHub Pages" scheme="https://sysutobo.github.io/blog/tags/GitHub-Pages/"/>
    <category term="博客" scheme="https://sysutobo.github.io/blog/tags/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>用 Hexo + NexT 在这台机器上搭了个静态博客，托管在 GitHub Pages。</p><span id="more"></span><p>首页按日期倒序列出文章，<code>Archives</code> 按年月归档，<code>Categories</code> &#x2F; <code>Tags</code> 自动聚合，RSS 在 <code>/atom.xml</code>。</p><p>写新文章的流程：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> ~/work/blog</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">export</span> PATH=<span class="variable">$HOME</span>/work/.node/bin:<span class="variable">$PATH</span></span><br><span class="line">npx hexo new <span class="string">&quot;文章标题&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable">$EDITOR</span> <span class="built_in">source</span>/_posts/2026-11-26-文章标题.md</span><br><span class="line">npx hexo server        <span class="comment"># 本地预览 http://localhost:4000/blog/</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>发布：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm run deploy         <span class="comment"># clean + generate，然后 push 到 gh-pages 分支</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>文章开头用 front matter 填 <code>title</code> &#x2F; <code>date</code> &#x2F; <code>categories</code> &#x2F; <code>tags</code>；<code>&lt;!-- more --&gt;</code> 以上是首页摘要。草稿用 <code>hexo new draft</code>，确认后 <code>hexo publish</code>。</p>]]>
    </content>
